  "description": "Evaluates models on the diplomatic transcription of pages from a mid-15th-century manuscript in late medieval German, the pilgrimage accounts of Hans and Peter Rot held by the Universitätsbibliothek Basel (H V 15). The model must keep historical spelling and abbreviations, identify the folio number, and separate main text from marginal additions without being given their regions (an implicit segmentation).",
